  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf \"Vaylantz World - Shinra Bansho\" is in
    a Field Zone or if you control a WATER \"Vaylantz\" monster: You can Special
    Summon this card to your Main Monster Zone in its same column. You can only use
    this effect of \"Nazuki the Vaylantz Ninja\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect
    ] \nYou can target 1 other monster in either Main Monster Zone; move that monster
    to an adjacent (horizontal) Monster Zone. If this card in the Monster Zone moves
    to another Monster Zone: You can target 1 \"Vaylantz\" Monster Card in your Spell
    & Trap Zone; Special Summon it to your Main Monster Zone in its same column.
    You can only use each effect of \"Nazuki the Vaylantz Ninja\" once per turn."
